],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "c44600cb",
"en_raw": "...Lots of cats?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "eec2bd72",
"en_raw": "Shiina, you mean"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "6b1e5c60",
"en_raw": "a cat gathering?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "24cf05da",
"en_raw": "get it at all"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "f2aa2d71",
"en_raw": "So Kurumi is asking"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "3069edae",
"en_raw": "whether it's bad-bad or happy"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "5fb71095",
"en_raw": "I have no idea"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "07fcc144",
"en_raw": "Nao, translate"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "6b6c6fb5",
"en_raw": "Shiina, what's bad-bad?"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "e4be788d",
"en_raw": "C-a-t F-o-r-t-u-n-e"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "f02a7986",
"en_raw": "is what it is"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "9d66ee60",
"en_raw": "...Cat fortune-telling?"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "986bec0f",
"en_raw": "Yes, and it tells you"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "fdb02431",
"en_raw": "how today will go!"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "913ac213",
"en_raw": "Oh, I've heard of it"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "a7db9cbb",
"en_raw": "By the color of the first cat"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "07d8939b",
"en_raw": "you see that day, you tell your luck, right?"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "6ce301bb",
"en_raw": "Right, right"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "a36ecf36",
"en_raw": "So basically, if you see several"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "1e552f14",
"en_raw": "cats at the same time"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "c36d5769",
"en_raw": "how does the reading turn out?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "cb37ebf6",
"en_raw": "...Is that what you mean?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "25d863c3",
"en_raw": "Yes... maybe?"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "17c1ca99",
"en_raw": "How stupid"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "ffd8cd5e",
"en_raw": "So today Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "c03aef9c",
"en_raw": "is going to meet the kitties"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "3bf9a358",
"en_raw": "The place is... Kurumazaka?"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "ed818bb5",
"en_raw": "The street beyond Hirumidaira housing"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "6faae306",
"en_raw": "with that shrine on it, right?"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "a07daf57",
"en_raw": "Yeah, around there"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "d7134d2c",
"en_raw": "Jelly-chan saw them"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "9bfb02ad",
"en_raw": "lots of cats"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "9754a29f",
"en_raw": "But if Melos is there"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "e61ffeb5",
"en_raw": "the cats will run away, won't they?"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "83e2af1a",
"en_raw": "So, Shiina, what did"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "81727738",
"en_raw": "the cats say?"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "83fe1dbf",
"en_raw": "It'll be Cat Hour soon"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "b52f24d8",
"en_raw": "so it's the Cat Path"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "5bfe400f",
"en_raw": "...Cat Path, as in a cat's road?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "7bbb315d",
"en_raw": "What's Cat Hour supposed to be?"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "817c0a4b",
"en_raw": "No idea, it comes after Mi"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "51cc4586",
"en_raw": "...Cat Hour"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "238d9641",
"en_raw": "Cat's hour... after Mi"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "9c4e1901",
"en_raw": "Sango, what's Mi?"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "75d03803",
"en_raw": "Mi is..."
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "52566bcd",
"en_raw": "Rat, Ox, Tiger, Dragon, Mi"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "e54cf72e",
"en_raw": "It's the 'Mi,' isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "48499ceb",
"en_raw": "You know, 'the hour of Mi'"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "5f4018de",
"en_raw": "Hmm"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "2ef1ce9e",
"en_raw": "So what time is the hour of Mi?"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "f7b5dbb3",
"en_raw": "Ox-three is 2 o'clock, so..."
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "0ec9447a",
"en_raw": "Hey, what's Ox Honey?"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "9e954cdc",
"en_raw": "Shiina, be quiet"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "f6567731",
"en_raw": "...Yeah, I guess five o'clock"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "13519780",
"en_raw": "Then it's after that"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "9de2f667",
"en_raw": "so if we go a bit late"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "68cb24d7",
"en_raw": "that should be fine, right?"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "e220b65d",
"en_raw": "How serious are you, exactly?"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "58dad9a8",
"en_raw": "...By the way, Nao"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "90d2d849",
"en_raw": "you're my age"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "fe4fa990",
"en_raw": "so you were born in the Year of the Cat, right?"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "9d3e82bc",
"en_raw": "Oh, is that so?"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "a22ea800",
"en_raw": "You see, the Cat Path"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "15e0c64c",
"en_raw": "is where the cats go in"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "e4a7940b",
"en_raw": "So cat gatherings"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "f917670c",
"en_raw": "really exist"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "6d000df3",
"en_raw": "Gathering, I mean"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "55f55af5",
"en_raw": "they're just clustered together"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "59832336",
"en_raw": "Besides, maybe I really"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "6ff16e29",
"en_raw": "just hate cats"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "d4c16967",
"en_raw": "I got goosebumps..."
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "99519bba",
"en_raw": "Meow meow, it's fun though"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "0d98fe12",
"en_raw": "By the way, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "39c0422d",
"en_raw": "that cat fortune-telling you wanted"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "99e23a93",
"en_raw": "to know about, did you find out?"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "062458d6",
"en_raw": "Hey, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "39c0422d",
"en_raw": "that cat fortune-telling you wanted"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "c43011b1",
"en_raw": "Did you find out?"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "c41c9809",
"en_raw": "Oh, I forgot!"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "393431b1",
"en_raw": "Um, right, right!"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "ccb8a6ba",
"en_raw": "It's a cat god, apparently"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "cc532c69",
"en_raw": "So did something good happen?"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "7933ed29",
"en_raw": "No..."
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "fd5dc078",
"en_raw": "You do a sleepy-sleepy charm"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "ad23cf7f",
"en_raw": "Hmm, what a weird god"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "8f0ef26e",
"en_raw": "Yeah..."
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "00b7a3bc",
"en_raw": "But Kurumi is Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "322c8597",
"en_raw": "But cat fortunes aside"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "fed75a83",
"en_raw": "in a place like that"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "91b34cc1",
"en_raw": "was there such a huge temple?"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "692aa52c",
"en_raw": "(Maybe it's one of"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "7a8f317b",
"en_raw": "the gods after all...)"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "cd446d9f",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Cat Gathering"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "9f3a30f9",
"en_raw": "But why do cats"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "417ad687",
"en_raw": "hold gatherings anyway..."
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "85ff66ad",
"en_raw": "Cats seem selfish"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "57a05846",
"en_raw": "and lonely, you know"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "20a8e25a",
"en_raw": "And yet they sometimes just gather"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "484004cc",
"en_raw": "That's kind of strange"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "7b7eec70",
"en_raw": "Sango, want to know?"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "51f61957",
"en_raw": "Then Kurumi will"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "6c025e15",
"en_raw": "ask them next time"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "a85f7425",
"en_raw": "Please do"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}